[en.DECISION_C02_LOW_SUPPORT_RATE]
Low Support Rate

[en.DECISION_C02_LOW_SUPPORT_RATE_desc]
Trixie’s poll results are not looking good, her support rate has dropped to an all-time low. After all, the public’s support is the last line of defense for Trixie to avoid being deposed by Empress Gozy Glow. When Trixie becomes useless, the Empress will not hesitate to abandon her.
If this situation is not quickly improved, it may lead to Trixie being §Rimpeached§! and an early §YThe Second Ponyville Election§!.

[zh.DECISION_C02_LOW_SUPPORT_RATE]
支持率低迷

[zh.DECISION_C02_LOW_SUPPORT_RATE_desc]
特丽克西的民调结果不容乐观，她的支持率已经降到了历史最低点。毕竟，民众的支持是特丽克西没有被和煦女皇废黜的最后一道防线，当特丽克西变得无用之时，女皇会毫不犹豫地将她抛弃。
如果不快速改善这一状态，可能会导致特丽克西被§R罢免§!并提前举行§Y第二届小马谷大选§!。
